# EventFlow – Event Booking and Ticketing Platform

A full-stack web application for browsing events, booking tickets, and processing payments via Stripe. Admins can manage events, monitor bookings, and view revenue analytics.

---

## Tech Stack

### Backend
- FastAPI
- PostgreSQL
- SQLAlchemy
- Alembic
- JWT Authentication
- Stripe Payment Integration

### Frontend
- React with Vite
- Axios
- Custom CSS
- Role-Based Routing

---

