## API Endpoints

### Auth

POST /auth/register
- Register a new user
- Auth Required: No

POST /auth/login
- Login and receive JWT token
- Auth Required: No

GET /auth/me
- Get current authenticated user
- Auth Required: Yes

---

### Events

GET /events
- List all events
- Auth Required: No

GET /events/{id}
- Get event details by ID
- Auth Required: No

POST /events
- Create a new event
- Auth Required: Admin only

PUT /events/{id}
- Update an existing event
- Auth Required: Admin only

DELETE /events/{id}
- Delete an event
- Auth Required: Admin only

---

### Bookings

POST /bookings
- Create a new booking
- Auth Required: Yes

GET /bookings
- List all bookings
- Auth Required: Admin only

GET /bookings/{id}
- Get booking details by ID
- Auth Required: Yes

GET /my-bookings
- Get current user's bookings
- Auth Required: Yes

---

### Payments

POST /payments/create-session
- Create a Stripe Checkout session
- Auth Required: Yes

POST /payments/webhook
- Handle Stripe webhook events
- Auth Required: Stripe Signature

---

### Admin Analytics

GET /admin/analytics/events
- View event performance analytics
- Auth Required: Admin only

GET /admin/analytics/revenue
- View revenue analytics and summaries
- Auth Required: Admin only

POST /admin/bookings/{id}/cancel
- Cancel a booking by ID
- Auth Required: Admin only

---

### Notifications

GET /notifications
- List notifications for the logged-in user
- Auth Required: Yes

PATCH /notifications/{id}/read
- Mark notification as read
- Auth Required: Yes